window.products.push({"id":1051007,"name":"ELIXIR GLASSWARE Crystal Champagne Flutes – Elegant Champagne Glasses, Hand Blown – Set of 4 Modern Champagne Flutes – Gift for Wedding, Anniversary, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yH-5H3CdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ BEAUTIFUL GLASSES TO FALL IN LOVE WITH – Pair the sensory delight of a fine champagne with the exquisite art form of these breathtaking glasses by Elixir Glassware. Contemporary, exceptionally clear body and slender stem gracefully showcases your drink. ✔ THE PERFECT GIFT FOR ANY OCCASION – Sophisticated, stunning and luxurious. A unique gift idea that is guaranteed to impress - wife, husband, mom, dad will love them. Don’t forget best friends! Celebrate life’s most memorable moments with a gift that speaks for itself – weddings, anniversaries, Mothers day, Fathers day, housewarming, or an engagement party. ✔ 100% LEAD FREE CRYSTAL – Unlike other glasses which contain at least 20% lead, Elixir Glassware is made from lead free ultra-clarity crystal. All the wonderful sparkle and flair of fine crystal glass stemware, tempered for durability. ✔ HANDMADE CRAFTSMANSHIP – Each glass is masterfully shaped and hand blown by artisans using traditional methods. The rim is carefully cut and polished to direct the wine to the center of the tongue, creating a harmony of fruit, acidity and tannin flavors. The result is a unique work of art – a delightful experience best shared with fine champagne and good company. ✔ SECURELY PACKAGED & SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – Buy with complete confidence and rest easy knowing that your gift will arrive promptly in perfect condition in the care of our secure, thick protective giftbox packaging. Enjoy our no compromise, Elixir 1 Year Satisfaction Guarantee. Beautiful glasses - beautiful service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yH-5H3CdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELIXIR GLASSWARE","source_asin":"B0BLZCN73P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLZCN73P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLZCN73P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1051008,"name":"Comfify Rustic Wall Mounted Coat Rack with 3 Sturdy Hooks – Set of 2 – Vintage Entryway Wooden Coat Racks Rustic Rack for Coats, Bags, Towels and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FGDEXlm3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Authentic rustic barnwood coat rack set of 2: This elegant wood coat rack can be mounted on a wall or door in any room of your house. Its retro design will easily match the interior décor of your entryway, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, mudroom, or even your office. Your guests will definitely compliment this entryway coat rack! Contemporary rustic design: Our paulownia wood is selected to guarantee great quality and endurance, as well as sturdiness and consistent aesthetic beauty of the design. These rustic coat racks are available in 3 beautiful colors: rustic white, torched brown and rustic blue. Effortless installation: 2 x 4cm screws and 2 drywall anchors are already included so you can install these wooden wall mounted racks easily, as soon as you take them out of the box. On the back side of our door hanger rack there are pre-drilled mounting holes, so that you can mount it on a wall or door effortlessly. Convenient size: With 17.5” x 6.10” you’ll be able to easily use it for hanging coats, bags, keys, towels and any other items you want while also giving you a vintage, farmhouse touch. Large space between hooks will allow you to hang even those fluffy winter coats and jackets. Light & sturdy paulownia wood: Paulownia wood is known to be one of the sturdiest and lightest woods available in the world, and it’s widely used in industries that require very light yet strong wood. Our product will fit your needs perfectly by being LIGHTWEIGHT but at the same time STURDY enough to hold your favorite belongings in place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FGDEXlm3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfify","source_asin":"B07KMG8SNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KMG8SNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KMG8SNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
