window.products.push({"id":1051057,"name":"6L Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room Home, Cool and Warm Humidifiers for Baby and Plants Mist Top Fill Desk Humidifiers Essential Oil Diffuser, Quiet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NRrJ1oSCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Ultrasonic Humidifier And Top-fill Design】：Our cool and warm mist humidifier has both cool and warm mist functions, which can be switched at the touch of a button.The powerful cool mist helps moisturize the dry air in the room and improve the quality of sleep. Warm mist is suitable for moisturizing the skin and relieving discomfort. Humidifier with top filling design, pure water can be added directly to the water tank. Perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, plants and offices. Note: Please remove the white foam from the base before use. ✅【6-liter Tank And 3 Levels Of Mist Adjustment】:The Smart Humidifier has an extra-large 6-liter water tank that will keep your room humidifier running properly for 60 hours with a single fill. 360° rotating nozzles allow the mist to disperse in any direction, providing even humidity and creating a soothing, comfortable environment. This smart humidifier features a smart sensor that automatically maintains a healthy room humidity level. What's more, we have three levels to freely choose from to meet the different needs of room humidity. ✅【Sleep Mode And Anti-dry Burn】：In sleep mode, the LED screen will turn off but still work normally, allowing you to sleep comfortably without being affected by light.Quietly emits a soothing, cool mist. Our bedroom humidifier keeps the humidity level in your room steady while you sleep, whether you're sleeping or working, so you can forget it's there and enjoy every breath. When the lack of water, the water shortage indicator on the screen will flash to remind, shut down the humidification function to prevent dry burning damage to the product. ✅【Aromatherapy And Easy To Clean】：The Coolfiqu is more than just a hhome humidifier, we've included an essential oil tray as well. You can drop essential oils into the tray and let the humidifier circulate the essential oils into a cool mist that will keep your office, home, bedroom,living room, nursery, and other rooms smelling great. When we clean the indoor humidifier, we only need to lift the water tank and wipe it gently with a damp cloth. Note: The atomizing sheet can only be wiped gently with a soft brush. ✅【Great Gifts And Satisfying Service】: The humidifier is perfect as a housewarming gift, birthday gift, Thanksgiving gift, Christmas gift for friends and family. When there is a problem, our customer support team is here to help. If you have a defective product, please contact us in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NRrJ1oSCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coolfiqu","source_asin":"B0C4L3TYMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4L3TYMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4L3TYMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
