window.products.push({"id":1051155,"name":"(Price/Pieces)Lovinghome™ 60-Minute \"Cute Chicken\" Kitchen Timer, Mechanical Timer, Perfect Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4192lyR+lIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Price is for 1 Pieces. This Upscale Timer adds a little whimsy to your kitchen. Keep track of the cooking times with this adorable Kitchen Timer. You can time up to 60 minutes, in one minute increments with this mechanical timer (no batteries). When time is up a bell alarm sounds. Makes a perfect little gift, especially around the holidays. Model: AKTJ-EN14312 Size: 2.76 x 2.36 inch (7cm x 6cm) Color: Red and White Material: ABS plastic Package: 1pc/white box Features: **Made of colorful plastic housing and metal bell, Attractive & Lovely design. **60 minute quartz timing capacity, Counts down between 1 and 60 minutes. **One minute increments allow for precise timing. **Wind up timer triggers pleasant ticking and alarm tone, Loud and long 3-4 second bell alarm alerts you when time is up. **Easy-to-operate mechanical pointer (no batteries), Large knob for easy turning. **Large, easy-to-read numerals on dial. **Measures 2.36 inch x 2.76 inch with a flat, stable base, Freestanding & portable. **Small enough that you can carry it with you--to the exercise room, to the garden, or around the block. **Wipe with damp cloth for cleaning, Not suitable for dishwashers. **Do not immerse in water. **Stylishly packaged and exceptional value. **Versatile for all your kitchen needs, Perfect to time all your favorite foods. **Add a splash of color to your kitchen with this vintage mechanical timer. **Great for kitchen, shower room, classroom, or anywhere you need a count down timer. This charming timer that goes with nearly any decor will brighten up your kitchen counter while it keeps your cookies, cakes, roasts, and casseroles from burning. The ringing tone will let you know when food is ready and remind you to take your pie out of the oven or check your pasta on the stove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4192lyR+lIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lovinghome","source_asin":"B001V7DP8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001V7DP8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001V7DP8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
