window.products.push({"id":1051165,"name":"ASIMIL Power Lift Recliners for Elderly with Heat and Massage Brown Leather Power Recliner 180°Recliening Degree Power Lift recliners with Dual OKIN C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SKVVfvfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛒【Best After-Sales Service】3 years warranty for frame/reclining mechanism,2 year warranty for motor/transformer/remote control and 1 year warranty for surface fabric.We know customers are worried about the quality of after-sales service,so we promise the best service to you.Comparing our warranty period with other sellers,you will find the difference. 🛒【Dual Motor Lift Recliner】Lifting this recliner by the 4 buttons remote controller,each motor operates quietly, smoothly and independently. The backrest and footrest can be adjustable individually. Backrest can be operated from 105° to 180°, Footrest can be operated from 90° to 180°, and position lock is infinite. You can adjust this recliner to your desired degree for your need, like reading, sleeping, watching video and so on. 🛒【Recliner with Massage & Heating Function】The best recliners for your home are the ones that do it all - reclining, massaging, and heating. 8 different modes meet your demand of different massage. The areas of massage focus lumbar, shoulder. You can freely choose the intensity and location of massage. Lumbar heating function with massage to make your waist more comfortable. 🛒【Humanistic Design & High Quality】The additional lumbar pillow provide extra support for the lumbar,more comfortable.Side hook design and small pocket design, easy to place the electric hand controller and massage hand controller. Construction is made by sturdy hardwood and steel, maximum weight capacity is 300 lbs. So this recliner can support you safely and be used for long-term.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SKVVfvfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASIMIL","source_asin":"B0BMZX6PJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMZX6PJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMZX6PJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1051166,"name":"Aarrt Heavy Duty Large Stainless Steel Bowls with Lids, Silicone Bottom Bowls, and Volume Measurements","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EqDmQr1NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Aarrt We love to cook. Just like you. We also believe that delicious recipes depend on great cookware. Our stainless steel mixing bowls are safer and easier to use than heavy glass or ceramic bowls, which slide around and shatter when dropped - ruining recipes and leaving glass shards all over your kitchen floor. These steel mixing bowls with lids are lighter, nearly indestructible, easily cleaned, and won't retain food odors and stains like melamine or plastic. They also look great in both the kitchen and dining room with stylish brushed steel exteriors and a polished interior finish. QUALITY MATERIALS Tight sealing, BPA free bowl covers keep food fresh and make it easy to transport your creations to a dinner party or potluck. Anti-slip silicone rubber bottoms grip the counter and stop bowls from sliding during heavy use - great for baking with kids! ERGONOMICALLY DESIGNED A comfortable, extra wide rolled lip and easy-grip collar give you exceptional control when mixing or pouring. Stackable lids and bowls save space in your cabinets and accurate measuring marks on the inside of the bowls in both liters and quarts make it easy to scale up your favorite recipes. CARE AND USE Our stainless steel mixing bowl set is dishwasher and freezer safe. Lids should be hand washed or washed on the top rack of the dishwasher on low heat. To get a tight seal, press down firmly in the center of the lid to close. This will \"burp\" out the air and ensure a great fit. BOWL DIMENSIONS Large Bowl: 5 qt volume, 10 5/16\" diameter, 5 1/2\" height  Medium Bowl: 3 qt volume, 8 3/4\" diameter, 4 1/2\" height  Small Bowl: 1 1/2 qt volume, 7 1/8\" diameter, 4\" height Packaged using 100% recyclable materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EqDmQr1NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aarrt","source_asin":"B01DHOV30G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DHOV30G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DHOV30G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
