window.products.push({"id":1051318,"name":"Dax 18x24 Flat Black Environmentally Friendly Wood Composite Wall Display Poster Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CdooISSyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dax 18x24 Flat Black Environmentally Wood Composite Wall Display Poster Frame The Dax 18x24 Flat Black Environmentally Wood Composite Wall Display Poster Frame is a perfect addition to any décor with it's classic flat profile and sleek black finish. This versatile wall display poster frame holds one 18 inch x 24 inch poster or art print. It includes hanging hardware for easy mounting onto any wall surface. Durable plexi provides a crystal clear layer of protection for your cherished memories for years to come. Crafted from environmentally wood composite that is both lightweight and durable. We are committed to making positive changes for the environment. We believe by developing sustainable products, we are protecting our future. It's the right thing to do for our planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CdooISSyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAX","source_asin":"B0061VA4Z8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0061VA4Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0061VA4Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
