window.products.push({"id":1051358,"name":"RNK Shops Flipflop Hand Towel - Full Print (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A9DRYcJbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of personality to any bathroom in your home with one of our personalized hand towels! Your hand towels, when customized, are both gorgeous and functional! Design a few to match the decorative themes of your bathrooms, or for a housewarming party as a thoughtful, one-of-a-kind gift!These bathroom hand towels feature two materials, making the texture softer and more luxurious. The front displays your customized design in vibrant colors against a smooth polyester, while the reverse side of this custom hand towel is made from white cotton loops, making this towel absorbent, lavish, and stylish! The dual textures feel great against your hands and face, making this towel multi-purpose and a perfect addition to your bathrooms. Each decorative hand towel measures approximately 15.5 by 24.5 inches.To clean your brand new, unique hand towel, we recommend washing it in the machine, separately, with cold water, mild detergent, and on a gentle cycle. We advise that you avoid bleach and other harsh detergents. To dry, tumble on low heat.Design Shown: FlipFlop (#198484)Features:==================================== * [Dual-texture]: Luxurious velour front and absorbent cotton loop back for comfort. * [Single Sided Print]: Vibrant full-color design on the front with a clean, white back. * [Versatile Size]: Approximately 24.5\" x 15.5\", ideal for various bathroom settings. * [Easy Care]: Machine washable with cold water and mild detergent on a gentle cycle.Care Instructions:==================================== * Machine wash separately in cold water, mild detergent * Avoid bleach and other harsh detergents * To dry, tumble on low","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A9DRYcJbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B017KFHHBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017KFHHBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017KFHHBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
