window.products.push({"id":1051416,"name":"BeeGreen Animal Reusable Grocery Bags Shopping Totes 12 Pack with Small bag Nylon Fabric 50LBS Foldable Groceries Bags Bulk Cute Large Heavy Duty Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8196JYJvF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multiple Animal Printing and Large Capacity: 14.2'W*27.5'L*4.7'D. The cute reusable grocery shopping bags have fashion animal printing. Our reusable shopping tote bags have 12 pack + 1 zipper bags for the package. And these foldable reusable grocery bags are huge which can hold up to 50+ pounds of groceries. The reusable grocery bags are reinforced with bias tape, which makes them hold heavy loads safely. Durable and Lightweight: All our washable reusable bags for shopping are made of nylon fabric which is lightweight yet sturdy and all seams are reinforced with bias tape which makes these collapsible reusable bags for shopping strong enough to pack heavy groceries, like canned goods, gallons of milk. Easy to Carry Around & Reusable: Our portable reusable shopping bags can be easily Rolled Up to small size with Elastic Ribbon for easy storage and carry it with you at all time. The compact grocery shopping bags folding can be easily stored in your pocket or purse to save space, or wherever is most convenient. Don't have bulky reusable bags all over the car! By reusing reusable tote bags & keeping plastic out of landfills & oceans! Suitable for Variety of Occasions: The 12 pack washable reusable groceries bags are fashion cute reusable gift bags. So excellent for daily supplies when you need for a trip or birthday party gift, Christmas day, holiday, grocery store, supermarket, etc. Our fashion geometric reusable bags can add some fun to your shopping grocery or just a cute fashion gift bags. Long handles allow for hand holding or carry on the shoulder for more comfortable carrying. Machine Washable and Reusable: Being washable is a must for any reusable tote bag. All our large reusable totes are Machine Washable! Toss these grocery totes right into the washer and save your time! You can help reduce your impact on the environment by using washable reusable bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8196JYJvF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B0B4B8SHP1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4B8SHP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4B8SHP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
