window.products.push({"id":1051423,"name":"4 Pack Ice Ball Maker Mold Whiskey Ice Mold Silicone Ice Cube Tray Candy Color Round Ice Cube Mold 2.5 Inch Creative Light Bulbs Ice Molds Sphere Ice ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xxob85AfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Package Included】You will get a set of four candy colored light bulb ball ice cube mold set.Contains purple,pink,blue,yellow and is equipped with 4pcs funnel.The sufficient quantity and rich colors of the ice ball maker mold fully meet your needs.Whiskey ice ball mold still yours a beautiful decoration for the refrigerator,which will give you a sense of accomplishment when you take out the perfectly shaped puck. 【High-Quality Material】Portable ice ball maker are made of high-quality silicone and AS materials,which are environmentally friendly,odor-free and BPA-free,round ice cube mold allowing you to use them more at ease.Combination of the two materials makes the spherical ice ball maker more flexible not easy to break,and prolongs its service life,better closure of the edges.This design allows the ice hockey mold to remain a perfect sphere after being filled with water.Ball ice maker supports reuse. 【Easy to Demould】Ice ball maker bottle is easy to use and very easy to demould.You only need to open the silicone dust cover,insert the funnel,pour water to the ball ice cube mold water level line,cover the lid,put it in the refrigerator for about 8 hours,take out the circle ice cube tray,After waiting for 1 minute,you can easily demould by squeezing the silicone bottom and you will have a perfectly shaped puck.Finally put it into your favorite drink and enjoy the moment. 【Multiple Uses】Sphere ice cube mold are exquisite and compact and the 2.5 inch extra large ice ball made can greatly enhance the flavor of drinks,ice cube mold will be the perfect companion for whiskey,cocktails,beer,vodka,juice,coffee,water beverages.It must be very homey to make delicious drinks for family and friends on a leisurely afternoon. 【Perfect Gift】Light bulbs ice molds is an indispensable must-have for making drinks at home,bars,outdoor parties,restaurants or the beach in summer.The width of the whiskey ball ice mold is about 2.63in,it portable does not take up space.Circle ice cube mold for whiskey is the perfect gift to share with friends,lovers,colleagues,family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xxob85AfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANIPHA","source_asin":"B0B4K6ZFFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4K6ZFFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4K6ZFFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1051424,"name":"Fox Run Tartlet Tin, Tin-Plated Steel, 4-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cui7m4ZYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want beautifully shaped tart shells? Made of durable tin-plated steel, this Tartlet Pan features a 4-inch diameter. Use this elegant mold for forming tart shells, so they can be filled and created into sweet desserts or savory snacks. Its small size can conveniently fit in the toaster oven and will take up minimal storage space. For mini desserts, fill with custard, fruit, whipped cream, or chocolate. For a delicious snack, fill with crab, cheese, or spinach and artichokes! The opportunities are endless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cui7m4ZYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fox Run","source_asin":"B001GIOX8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001GIOX8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001GIOX8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1051425,"name":"Abstract Map of the World by Michael Tompsett, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bYfhcHKGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features an abstract world map. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs.  Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bYfhcHKGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00C7OXPUY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C7OXPUY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C7OXPUY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
