window.products.push({"id":1051458,"name":"T-One cocktail kingdom Stainless Steel Cocktail Jigger Bar Essential Tool, 1oz 2oz Alcohol Measuring Tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514Va5CyVkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The slender shape of this measuring jigger is good for smoothness and easy dumping. The seamless interior design is easy to clean. Exquisite wine utensils suitable for professional bartenders and family lovers. Our liquor measuring jigger has everything you need to shake, stir and pour the perfect cocktail. The series aims to make perfect cocktails with various tools to ensure excellent results. From preparation to decoration, this comprehensive range of working wine utensils and accessories is designed for precision, control and accuracy. Use our professional tools for cocktail bartending tools to add an exciting atmosphere to your bar or party. They have always performed well and look great.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514Va5CyVkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-One","source_asin":"B097PNDP1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097PNDP1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097PNDP1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1051459,"name":"HOME-X Stainless-Steel Melting Pots-Set of 2, Mini Saucepans with Pouring Spout, Stovetop Milk Warmer, Turkish Coffee Maker, Gravy Warmer, Butter Melt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JZgV7UmZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add the HOME-X Stainless-Steel Warming Pots to your cooking tool arsenal for everyday melting and heating of liquid ingredients. Each pot is designed with a spout on the rim for precise pouring of whatever you're warming or boiling. This set includes two pots one small and on mini for preparing a variety of dishes, whether you're making warm beverages for the whole family or creating chocolate-dipped treats for friends. Stovetop food preparation can help increase the quality of your final dish, so use these pots to add that special, home-cooked touch. There's no point in wasting a large pan to melt a few tablespoons of butter or the 1 cup of milk called-for in a recipe. Instead of risking a mess in your microwave, keep a close watch on your ingredients by using the small cooking pot on your stove. This is also an ideal tool if you need a butter warmer for seafood. Just melt your butter in one of the two pots in this set and then separate it into individual serving containers for your guests. Use the large melting pot for a creative and fun fondue night. Melt cheese, chocolate, or create other sweet and savory sauces in a large quantity for your guests to use for dipping. You don't have to use these saucepans just to heat up water. Use this set to create cuisine or drinks from around the world! Do you know what a classic cup of rich Arabic, Turkish, and Greek coffee all have in common? They all begin with a cup of finely ground coffee boiled on the stove. Use this as a stovetop milk steamer to make a creamy cup of chai from scratch on a cold day. If you're a baker or a candymaker, you definitely need one of these around to warm butter for the perfect pie crust or melt caramel for candy apples. These can even be used for crafting if you need a wax pouring pot for making a candle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JZgV7UmZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08SHG8NPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SHG8NPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SHG8NPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
