window.products.push({"id":1051599,"name":"StillCool 300 LED Curtain String Lights (9.8 x 9.8 ft) 8 Modes Fairy Lights Remote Control USB Powered Waterproof Lights for Indoor Outdoor Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719bPzuhlYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"✔️【Newest LED String Lights】 Compared to most 3.5mm copper wire lights on the market, we use high-quality 3.8mm copper wire and add a PVC tube on the outside to wrap it, which makes it more durability and can withstand extreme external environments(rain, snow, extrusion, collision, etc). The wrapped curtain lights are completely sealed, it is very safe to touch, and there is no danger of electric shock or fire. ✔️【IP68 Waterproof and USB Powered】The waterproof of the upgraded light string reaches IP68, so the wire parts of the string lights can be submersible. Perfect for indoor or outdoor wall lighting. This hanging lights can be powered by USB charger, notebook PC USB, Power bank and etc.(Note: USB Charger Not Included! And the the USB part is IP44, so please keep USB away from water) ✔️【Remote Control + Timer Function】Use the 13-KEY remote control for easily operation; Select your favorite mode between 8 Lighting Modes buttons. The remote controllable distance is 8-12 meters(distance without obstacles); Press \"+\" and \"-\" to adjust the brightness through the controller; The light will be 6-hour on and 18-hour off when you press the \"TIMER\" button of remote control. ✔️【8 Lighting Modes 】With the remote control, you can find out that the light tube has 8 light effects (Combination, In-Wave, Sequential, Slow Glow, Chasing, Slow Fade, Twinkle, Steady On). Widely use for Christmas, party, Valentine's Day, wedding, home, window, bathroom, Holiday, restaurant, hotel, commercial building, shopping center etc. ✔️【This lights will make your life lovely】 The fairy lights are flexible and easy to shape. It can be easily bent and shaped in potted plants, flower beds, display cases, walls, ceilings, windows, Christmas trees, garden paths, patios, courtyards, lawns and many other places. These mini lights can easily be turned into any desired shape. After use, the LED strip can be rolled up to keep it clean for the next use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719bPzuhlYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StillCool","source_asin":"B08HM3SR35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HM3SR35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HM3SR35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
