window.products.push({"id":1051846,"name":"Paw Patrol Party Supplies and Decorations, Paw Patrol Birthday Party Supplies, Serves 16 Guests, Officially Licensed with Table Cover, Banner Decor, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DdMfVBCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Join Chase, Marshall, Skye, Rubble, Rocky, and Everest in throwing your child a fun birthday party they will always remember! The Paw Patrol Birthday Party Supplies kit contains everything you need for easy, fast setup and takedown. This party pack includes more than just disposable dinnerware--it also has festive decorations perfect for tying the room together, matching cake candles, temporary tattoos, and an It's My Birthday! button for the guest of honor. Total Pieces -- This set includes enough Paw Patrol themed supplies to host a party of 16 guests: 1 table cover, 1 shield pennant banner, 16 large 9\" paper plates, 16 small 7\" paper plates, 16 paper cups, 16 paper napkins, 12 cake candles, 24 temporary tattoos, and 1 It's My Birthday! button. Decorations -- The Shield Pennant banner is a fun way to add a little extra pop, and measures 5 feet long. Suspend it over the gift table, or use it to give a little extra flash to the seat of honor. The leakproof tablecloth measures 54\" x 84\", and should fit most six person dining tables comfortably. Tableware -- All dishes, napkins and cups are made from high quality heavy duty paper, and can easily hold any kind of food or drink without leaking. They're sturdy enough to be used without a table, so guests can mingle as they eat. Larger plates are good for both dining and serving, such as pizza or hot dogs. Smaller plates are ideally sized for snacks, cupcakes, or cake and ice cream. And More -- Branded temporary tattoos feature go on easily, last for hours, and wash off with just soap and water. 16 blue cake candles are perfect for wishing the guest of honor a happy birthday. An It's My Birthday! button is the perfect accessory for the birthday boy or girl.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DdMfVBCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unique","source_asin":"B08N6YPXVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N6YPXVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N6YPXVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
