window.products.push({"id":1051955,"name":"Ravmix 30 Momme Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin with Hidden Zipper Both Sides Soft Breathable 100% Pure Mulberry Silk, Queen Size 20×30inch, 1PCS, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kXilfBcPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MORE LUXURIOUS BEDDING: Ravmix 30 momme silk pillowcase is made of 100% long strand grade 6A pure mulberry silk on BOTH sides! The density of silk is measured by momme. The higher the momme, the more silk. Ravmix 30 momme silk pillowcase is 58% more silk than the 19momme silk pillowcase and 25% more silk than the 25momme silk pillowcase. That results in a thicker, more durable, more luxurious and longer lasting silk pillowcase REDUCE BED HEAD AND SPLIT ENDS: Are you tired of waking up in the morning and having hair that looks like you just stuck your finger in a socket? Sleeping on luxury silk pillowcases will help keep that bed head under control. The smooth surface of silk can help reduce friction on your hair which often causes damage, like split ends. For your hair, it truly does pay to sleep on a silk pillowcase ANTI-AGING and REDUCING FACIAL WRINKLES: Silk pillowcase will help your skin stay more hydrated than many fabrics on the market. Sleeping on a silk pillowcase is a great option for helping reducing the appearance of facial wrinkles PRACTICAL HIDDEN ZIPPER: We've incorporated a side entry, hidden zipper that keeps the pillow secure and allows you to sleep on either side. Compared to the envelope closure, a hidden zipper makes your pillow stay placed in the silk pillowcase perfectly overnight without moving around. And you don't need to worry about your hair tangled by zipper since it was \"Hidden\", you don't even notice it WHAT YOU GET: 1-Pack 30 momme silk pillowcase(gift box packaged)! We recommend buying 2 or more, not only for backup use while the other one is being laundered and dried, but also for a travel necessity. Beautifully wrapped in our brand package box, making it a perfect gift for a holiday or special occasion! If there is any quality problems, please email us freely, we will work with you to make it right","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kXilfBcPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ravmix","source_asin":"B085ZLJGG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085ZLJGG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085ZLJGG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
