window.products.push({"id":1051994,"name":"Pure Egyptian California King Size Cotton Bed Sheets Set (Cal King, 1000 Thread Count) Cream Bedding and Pillow Cases (4 Pc) – Egyptian Cotton Sheets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WszClkj4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top Quality Egyptian Cotton Sheets Cal King: Our Cream, cal king sheets deep pocket are as soft and comfortable as it gets and will have you sleeping like a baby. These deep pocket cal sheets king are Standard 100 by OEKO-TEX, leaving no worries of thread count & performance. 1000 Thread Count, Deep Pocket Sheets Cal King (4 Piece Set): These luxurious, 1000 thread count sheets cal king come with a flat sheet (108” x 102”), a deep fitted sheets cal king size (72” x 84” + 16”) with an all-around elastic that fits an 16” deep mattress, & a pair of 21 x 41” pillowcases. Silky Soft Sheets! These Egyptian cotton sheets set are made from pure Egyptian cotton which is renowned for its softness and durability. These are sateen weave sheets that offer a lavish look to the room a great night’s sleep to you! Our California king Cream sheet set, will make you feel like you are on cloud 9, literally! Anti-Pilling & Fade Resistant: Our Cream sateen sheets cal king size sets use top quality anti-pilling and fade resistant yarns. We believe you deserve the best. Why risk it with other Cream sheets California king size that itch and fade in the wash? Here at Thread Spread, we are devoted to serving you with the best sheets possible! In the unlikely scenario of rising quality issues, you can directly write to us so we can address your problems best and on top priority. We also offer our customers a 30 day return and refund policy if they find they are unhappy with the product. Care Guidance: Machine wash our 100% cotton cal king size sheets in warm water and tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach. When machine drying, do not dry at high temperatures. For bed linens it is important to remove from dryer before completely dry, gently fold then iron, if needed. Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WszClkj4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B01K9UMFUS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1051994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K9UMFUS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K9UMFUS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
